Campus FAQ Helpdesk Knowledge Base (Sample Dataset for RAG)
Library
Students may borrow up to 4 books for 14 days. Two renewals are allowed if the book
is not reserved. Late fine: Rs.5 per day per book.
Hostel
Curfew is 9:00 PM on weekdays and 10:00 PM on weekends. Late entry requires prior
approval from the warden.
Attendance
Minimum attendance required is 75% to be eligible for semester examinations.
Fee Payment
Semester fees must be paid before the notified deadline. Late payment may incur
penalties.
Internal Exams
Two internal assessments are conducted every semester.
Bonafide Certificate
Apply through the student portal or administration office. Processing time is 2–3
working days.
Placement Cell
Provides career guidance, aptitude training, mock interviews and campus placements.
Anti-Ragging
The institution follows a zero-tolerance anti-ragging policy.
FAQs

Q: How many books can I borrow? A: Four.
Q: Can I enter the hostel at 10 PM on Saturday? A: Yes, weekend curfew is 10 PM; later
entry requires permission.
Q: Minimum attendance? A: 75%.